  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-027 (Phase 3 — engine / Parsing (`HFRParsing`)): User profile page parser (`/hfr/profil-NNN.htm`: fields, avatar, personal smileys).\n\n### Scope\n\nUser profile page parser (`/hfr/profil-NNN.htm`: fields, avatar, personal smileys)\n\n- Module: HFRParsing · Difficulty: medium · Priority: —\n- Audit source: review F4\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-010 (#43), LOT-020 (#48), LOT-005 (#42)\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-027-profile-parser.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-027-profile-parser.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#59](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/59) — LOT-027: public profile parser (merged; work)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#58](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/58) — docs(lots): wave 4 statuses, LOT-005 (#42) done, claim LOT-027 (merged; related)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#44](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/44) — Claim wave 3: LOT-025 (#53), LOT-026 (#54); LOT-027 blocked on R56 (merged; related)\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: cloud/c10-sonnet (2026-10-26)\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-profile-logged-in-banned-deleted-member (#124)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#59)`.\n",
